{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategies","title":"迁移策略：Polyrepo 到 Monorepo 的完整方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/migration-strategies","wordCount":1115,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"迁移策略-polyrepo-到-monorepo-的完整方法论\">迁移策略：Polyrepo 到 Monorepo 的完整方法论</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>迁移策略</td>\n<td>将代码从一种仓库组织方式迁移到另一种的系统性方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git 历史保留</td>\n<td>迁移时将原仓库的 commit 历史合并到 Monorepo，保留 blame/log 可追溯性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进式迁移</td>\n<td>分批次将仓库迁入 Monorepo，而非一次性大迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径重写</td>\n<td>使用 <code>git filter-repo</code> 等工具将仓库的文件路径添加目录前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向迁移</td>\n<td>从 Monorepo 拆分出独立仓库的过程（Monorepo → Polyrepo）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结期</td>\n<td>迁移执行期间，源仓库停止新功能开发的时间窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"迁移前的评估与决策\">迁移前的评估与决策</h2><p>在开始迁移之前，必须先回答以下问题，否则迁移可能弊大于利。</p>\n<h3 id=\"迁移驱动力评估\">迁移驱动力评估</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迁移驱动力</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跨包原子提交需求频繁</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最强的迁移信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具链维护成本高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>各仓库 ESLint/TS 版本不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码共享但通过 npm 发布</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>内部包通过 npm 迭代慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队工作方式强关联</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>团队组织架构与 Monorepo 匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅想统一管理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不足以驱动迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若迁移驱动力不强，应优先改善现有 Polyrepo 工具链（统一 CI 模板、共享配置），而非迁移。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规模估算\">规模估算</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 评估仓库数量和代码量&#10;for repo in $(cat repos.txt); do&#10;  LINES=$(git -C &quot;$repo&quot; ls-files | xargs wc -l 2&gt;/dev/null | tail -1)&#10;  echo &quot;$repo: $LINES lines&quot;&#10;done&#10;&#10;# 分析各仓库间的依赖关系&#10;for repo in $(cat repos.txt); do&#10;  DEPS=$(cat &quot;$repo/package.json&quot; | jq -r &#39;.dependencies // {} | keys[]&#39; | grep &quot;@myorg/&quot; | tr &#39;\\n&#39; &#39; &#39;)&#10;  echo &quot;$repo → $DEPS&quot;&#10;done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 评估仓库数量和代码量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repos.txt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  LINES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls-files</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$LINES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lines\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分析各仓库间的依赖关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repos.txt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  DEPS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/package.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.dependencies // {} | keys[]'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"@myorg/\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '\\n'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> → </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$DEPS</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"迁移方案选择\">迁移方案选择</h2><h3 id=\"方案一-全新-monorepo-渐进迁入-推荐\">方案一：全新 Monorepo + 渐进迁入（推荐）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[创建新 Monorepo 仓库] --&gt; B[配置工具链\\npackage manager + CI]&#10;    B --&gt; C[迁入优先级最高的 2-3 个仓库]&#10;    C --&gt; D[验证工具链正常运行]&#10;    D --&gt; E{还有仓库?}&#10;    E -- 是 --&gt; F[迁入下一批]&#10;    F --&gt; E&#10;    E -- 否 --&gt; G[归档原仓库]\">graph TD\n    A[创建新 Monorepo 仓库] --&gt; B[配置工具链\\npackage manager + CI]\n    B --&gt; C[迁入优先级最高的 2-3 个仓库]\n    C --&gt; D[验证工具链正常运行]\n    D --&gt; E{还有仓库?}\n    E -- 是 --&gt; F[迁入下一批]\n    F --&gt; E\n    E -- 否 --&gt; G[归档原仓库]</pre><p><strong>优势</strong>：风险可控，可以随时暂停；工具链可在早期验证。</p>\n<p><strong>劣势</strong>：过渡期内两个体系并存，需要维护 npm link 或临时发布。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方案二-直接合并-适合小型项目\">方案二：直接合并（适合小型项目）</h3><p>直接使用 <code>git subtree</code> 或 <code>git filter-repo</code> 将所有仓库合并到一个新仓库。适合仓库数量 &lt; 10 且团队能接受短暂冻结期的场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方案三-从现有仓库扩展\">方案三：从现有仓库扩展</h3><p>将最核心的现有仓库改造为 Monorepo 根，其他仓库逐步迁入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"携带-git-历史的迁移\">携带 git 历史的迁移</h2><p>保留 git 历史是迁移时最常被忽略但至关重要的一步。没有历史，<code>git blame</code> 和 <code>git log</code> 将失效，代码可追溯性大幅降低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用-git-filter-repo-迁移-推荐工具\">使用 git filter-repo 迁移（推荐工具）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 git-filter-repo&#10;pip install git-filter-repo&#10;&#10;# Step 1：克隆源仓库（创建副本，不影响原仓库）&#10;git clone --no-local packages-utils-source packages-utils-copy&#10;cd packages-utils-copy&#10;&#10;# Step 2：将所有文件移动到子目录（添加路径前缀）&#10;git filter-repo --to-subdirectory-filter packages/utils&#10;&#10;# Step 3：在目标 Monorepo 中添加 remote&#10;cd path/to/monorepo&#10;git remote add utils-source ../packages-utils-copy&#10;&#10;# Step 4：拉取历史&#10;git fetch utils-source&#10;&#10;# Step 5：合并历史（允许无关历史合并）&#10;git merge utils-source/main --allow-unrelated-histories -m &quot;chore: import packages/utils from packages-utils repo&quot;&#10;&#10;# Step 6：清理 remote&#10;git remote remove utils-source\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 git-filter-repo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git-filter-repo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 1：克隆源仓库（创建副本，不影响原仓库）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-local</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages-utils-source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages-utils-copy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages-utils-copy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 2：将所有文件移动到子目录（添加路径前缀）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to-subdirectory-filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages/utils</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 3：在目标 Monorepo 中添加 remote</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> path/to/monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> utils-source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../packages-utils-copy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 4：拉取历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> utils-source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 5：合并历史（允许无关历史合并）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> utils-source/main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --allow-unrelated-histories</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"chore: import packages/utils from packages-utils repo\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Step 6：清理 remote</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> utils-source</span></span></code></pre></div><p>执行后，<code>packages/utils/</code> 目录下的所有文件都带有完整的原始 git 历史。</p>\n<h3 id=\"批量迁移脚本\">批量迁移脚本</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# migrate-repos.sh&#10;set -e&#10;&#10;MONOREPO=&quot;$(pwd)&quot;&#10;REPOS=(&#10;  &quot;packages-utils:packages/utils&quot;&#10;  &quot;packages-ui:packages/ui&quot;&#10;  &quot;app-web:apps/web&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;for entry in &quot;${REPOS[@]}&quot;; do&#10;  REPO_NAME=&quot;${entry%%:*}&quot;&#10;  TARGET_PATH=&quot;${entry##*:}&quot;&#10;&#10;  echo &quot;Migrating $REPO_NAME to $TARGET_PATH...&quot;&#10;&#10;  # 克隆并重写路径&#10;  git clone --no-local &quot;$SOURCE_DIR/$REPO_NAME&quot; /tmp/$REPO_NAME-copy&#10;  cd /tmp/$REPO_NAME-copy&#10;  git filter-repo --to-subdirectory-filter &quot;$TARGET_PATH&quot;&#10;&#10;  # 合并到 Monorepo&#10;  cd &quot;$MONOREPO&quot;&#10;  git remote add &quot;$REPO_NAME&quot; /tmp/$REPO_NAME-copy&#10;  git fetch &quot;$REPO_NAME&quot;&#10;  git merge &quot;$REPO_NAME/main&quot; --allow-unrelated-histories \\&#10;    -m &quot;chore: import $TARGET_PATH from $REPO_NAME&quot;&#10;  git remote remove &quot;$REPO_NAME&quot;&#10;&#10;  # 清理临时目录&#10;  rm -rf /tmp/$REPO_NAME-copy&#10;  echo &quot;Done: $REPO_NAME → $TARGET_PATH&quot;&#10;done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># migrate-repos.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MONOREPO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pwd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">REPOS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"packages-utils:packages/utils\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"packages-ui:packages/ui\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"app-web:apps/web\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">REPOS</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dar