tyle=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$REPO_NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-copy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Done: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$REPO_NAME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> → </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$TARGET_PATH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"迁移后的工具链适配\">迁移后的工具链适配</h2><p>代码合并只是第一步，接下来需要适配 Monorepo 工具链：</p>\n<h3 id=\"package-json-适配\">package.json 适配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 将各包的独立依赖移入各自目录，根目录只保留工具链&#10;# 对于内部包引用，改用 workspace 协议&#10;&#10;# 原仓库 packages/ui/package.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;1.2.3&quot;  # 指向 npm 上的已发布版本&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 迁移后 packages/ui/package.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;  # 改为 workspace 协议&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将各包的独立依赖移入各自目录，根目录只保留工具链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对于内部包引用，改用 workspace 协议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原仓库 packages/ui/package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"1.2.3\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 指向 npm 上的已发布版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 迁移后 packages/ui/package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 改为 workspace 协议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ci-配置适配\">CI 配置适配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 原仓库 CI：全量构建&#10;- run: npm test&#10;&#10;# 迁移后：增量构建&#10;- run: |&#10;    nx affected -t test \\&#10;      --base=origin/main \\&#10;      --head=HEAD\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原仓库 CI：全量构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 迁移后：增量构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    nx affected -t test \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --base=origin/main \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --head=HEAD</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见迁移问题\">常见迁移问题</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包名冲突</td>\n<td>不同仓库有同名文件/包</td>\n<td>迁移前统一命名规范，使用 scoped 包名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖版本冲突</td>\n<td>各仓库使用不同版本的相同依赖</td>\n<td>通过 pnpm overrides 统一版本，逐步升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>git 历史过大</td>\n<td>历史中有大文件或不必要的历史</td>\n<td>使用 <code>git filter-repo --strip-blobs-bigger-than 1M</code> 清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 速度下降</td>\n<td>未配置增量构建</td>\n<td>立即配置 affected 分析和 Remote Cache</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建顺序错误</td>\n<td>内部依赖未正确声明</td>\n<td>检查 <code>workspace:*</code> 引用，运行 <code>turbo build --dry=json</code> 验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反向迁移-monorepo-polyrepo\">反向迁移：Monorepo → Polyrepo</h2><p>有时也需要从 Monorepo 中拆分出独立仓库（如：某个包需要独立开源、或某个团队需要完全独立的部署流水线）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 从 Monorepo 中提取 packages/utils 为独立仓库&#10;cd monorepo&#10;&#10;# 克隆当前 Monorepo&#10;git clone . /tmp/utils-extracted&#10;cd /tmp/utils-extracted&#10;&#10;# 只保留 packages/utils 目录的历史&#10;git filter-repo --subdirectory-filter packages/utils&#10;&#10;# 将提取的仓库推送到新的远程&#10;git remote add origin https://github.com/myorg/utils.git&#10;git push -u origin main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 Monorepo 中提取 packages/utils 为独立仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 克隆当前 Monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/utils-extracted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/utils-extracted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只保留 packages/utils 目录的历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --subdirectory-filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> packages/utils</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将提取的仓库推送到新的远程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/myorg/utils.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"迁移检查清单\">迁移检查清单</h2><p>完整迁移应按以下检查清单执行：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>创建 Monorepo 基础结构（pnpm-workspace.yaml、根 package.json）</li>\n<li>配置构建编排工具（turbo.json 或 nx.json）</li>\n<li>配置共享工具链（ESLint、TSConfig、Prettier）</li>\n<li>携带 git 历史导入所有目标仓库</li>\n<li>将内部依赖改为 <code>workspace:*</code> 协议</li>\n<li>运行 <code>pnpm install</code> 验证依赖解析正常</li>\n<li>运行 <code>turbo build</code> 或 <code>nx build :all</code> 验证构建成功</li>\n<li>配置 CI：增量构建 + Remote Cache + affected 分析</li>\n<li>配置 CODEOWNERS 文件</li>\n<li>归档（而非删除）原仓库，并在 README 中添加迁移说明</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Monorepo 迁移是一项系统工程，成功的关键在于规划周全和渐进执行：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>迁移驱动力不足时不应强迁</strong>：迁移有成本，需要真实的痛点驱动</li>\n<li><strong>携带 git 历史是必须的</strong>：失去历史会大幅降低代码可维护性</li>\n<li><strong><code>git filter-repo</code> 是最佳工具</strong>：比 <code>git subtree</code> 更灵活、更快速</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式迁移优于大爆炸</strong>：先迁最相关的 2-3 个仓库，验证工具链，再扩展</li>\n<li><strong>工具链适配与代码迁移同等重要</strong>：增量构建、Remote Cache、CODEOWNERS 要在迁移同期配置</li>\n<li><strong>反向迁移能力同样重要</strong>：必要时能从 Monorepo 提取出独立仓库，避免锁死</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"ci-optimization-monorepo\">CI 优化策略</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"code-ownership-boundaries\">代码所有权与边界</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迁移策略：Polyrepo 到 Monorepo 的完整方法论","id":"迁移策略-polyrepo-到-monorepo-的完整方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移前的评估与决策","id":"迁移前的评估与决策"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移驱动力评估","id":"迁移驱动力评估"},{"level":3,"text":"规模估算","id":"规模估算"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移方案选择","id":"迁移方案选择"},{"level":3,"text":"方案一：全新 Monorepo + 渐进迁入（推荐）","id":"方案一-全新-monorepo-渐进迁入-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"方案二：直接合并（适合小型项目）","id":"方案二-直接合并-适合小型项目"},{"level":3,"text":"方案三：从现有仓库扩展","id":"方案三-从现有仓库扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"携带 git 历史的迁移","id":"携带-git-历史的迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 git filter-repo 迁移（推荐工具）","id":"使用-git-filter-repo-迁移-推荐工具"},{"level":3,"text":"批量迁移脚本","id":"批量迁移脚本"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移后的工具链适配","id":"迁移后的工具链适配"},{"level":3,"text":"package.json 适配","id":"package-json-适配"},{"level":3,"text":"CI 配置适配","id":"ci-配置适配"},{"level":3,"text":"常见迁移问题","id":"常见迁移问题"},{"level":2,"text":"反向迁移：Monorepo → Polyrepo","id":"反向迁移-monorepo-polyrepo"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移检查清单","id":"迁移检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代码所有权与边界：CODEOWNERS 与模块边界约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/code-ownership-boundaries"},"next":null}